は AMD、サーバ、IoT は ARM ってなると、もう戦う場所が無いですね…","ts":"1637730013.175200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q8Xt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18469740-9c5a-4e53-8400-4c4d4d99c3e2","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"arm 実用の波がきちゃいましたねー。最初はいつ来るか分からんからとりあえず x86_64 使っておけみたいなのあったけど、Go も Java も普通に arm で動くし、intel は辛いなぁ。","ts":"1637729814.174200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y=vB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a0f5a5d-2230-46fd-ac97-13e1537404e1","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"仮に開発費や調達費の回収を考えるにしても、x86で十分に需要を理解できてるわけで、強気の価格設定しても十分短時間で回収できるってのはありそうですよね。","ts":"1637718530.172700","edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1637718553.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2sk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0390bbc-13b4-4393-a616-f524de19e484","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほどおお","ts":"1637718365.171600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E=Rk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bc4ed26-628f-4a7d-9d6f-4fb5a3916984","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; 1ラックあたりに投入できる電力量には上限があるので、消費電力に差があると、1ラック中に詰め込めるCPU数≒インスタンス数に違いがでるよね。\nたしかにいい","ts":"1637718361.171400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=O7aC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b9ae471-ad9c-4639-8b45-ea95c9c3ddc7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"もちろん調達やメンテナンスの手間とかもろもろ自前でやると安くなってるかもだけど、主要因は電力低減に伴う実装密度上昇もあるかなと、考えています。","ts":"1637718109.171200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+ny3Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac68a0c4-d506-47fc-bb08-639b2dac73a3","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"1ラックあたりに投入できる電力量には上限があるので、消費電力に差があると、1ラック中に詰め込めるCPU数≒インスタンス数に違いがでるよね。","ts":"1637717874.168700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xdy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de0c9e71-7372-4a14-81b6-73e011666078","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1637717718.166500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DRsp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4617935-76e8-4bc1-9a95-b3c4fc553566","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"CPUの調達価格、まぁ数があれば効いてくるのは確実だけど、一回限りだからそんな従量課金ならそんな気にしないでも良い。というか自分がサービス設計者ならそこまで気にしない。","ts":"1637717679.166100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1637717704.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ENpQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d06b8765-dc58-4d0a-ad75-ec20d20b137c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"根本は電力だと思うな。あと最大パフォーマンスがIntelより若干悪いはず。","ts":"1637717580.164500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5v1e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ab1a231-beb0-4119-b0fe-ee547d8588af","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1637716894.163700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H5It"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31899f21-eb04-45f0-a4d6-4577f443e797","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"自家製ARMなのか","ts":"1637716893.163400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9BYNx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4edae89b-c63e-4fe8-b725-900d2e789255","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/toricls/status/1463313382350622727?s=20\u003e","ts":"1637716883.163000","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/toricls|@toricls\u003e: \u003chttps://twitter.com/gorilla0513|@gorilla0513\u003e Arm vs Intel で Arm-based チップがパフォーマンスあたりの価格が安くなり